title: Confronting the Far Right
new-page: true
is-card: true
view-if: (afd_r >= 10 and afd_urgency > 1) and confronting_nazis_timer == 0
on-arrival: confronting_nazis_seen += 1; confronting_nazis_timer = 5; month_actions += 1
card-image: img/iron_front.png
tags: party_affairs; antifascism

The AfD is growing, and its most radical wing sets the tone. The Verfassungsschutz rates it as a confirmed right-wing extremist party, and in parts of the East it is the strongest party by far.

Many in our party, above all the Jusos and the Parlamentarische Linke, are calling for urgent action. Others warn that attacking the AfD only makes it stronger.

- @not_a_big_deal: The AfD will fall apart over its own contradictions. Let's not overreact.
- @economic_crisis
- @major_crisis: We must do something to confront the far right.
- @easy_discard

@not_a_big_deal
on-arrival: afd_urgency -= 1; left_dissent += 10

We will not let the AfD set our agenda. The Jusos accuse the leadership of complacency.

@economic_crisis
title: We must address the economic crisis first.
view-if: economic_plan == 0 and recession_seen == 1
go-to: crisis_program

@major_crisis
view-if: afd_urgency < 5
on-arrival: afd_urgency += 1; left_dissent -= 5; left_strength += 3

The far right is one of the greatest threats to the republic. We are still working out a strategy and building agreement in the party. We will come back to this.
